#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Production art for the film edition (design/film-adaptation.md).

The game assets the default edition needs to follow Méliès's 1903 film: the
prince's full sprite set, the new cast, props, and the sets for the new
scenes. Sizes match the sprites they replace, so delivered art drops into the
existing drawing code. Running the script rewrites the block between the FILM
ASSETS markers in design/image-requests.md and adds each id to
assets/manifest.json as a `requested` slot marked `"edition": "film"` (the
legacy generator leaves those alone). Delivered slots are never touched.

    python3 kingdomofthefairies/design/source/build_film_assets.py          # write
    python3 kingdomofthefairies/design/source/build_film_assets.py --check  # verify up to date
"""
